Z||000010||REDHOTT88||12-10-2001||08:05 PM||||Yes!!!<P>I've ordered the "Fear This" decal package!<BR>It comes with an assortment of decals that should boost my engine another 10HP!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"><P>Combine that with the chromed fart can, "cannon" size, I should have a about 280 HP!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>But seriously, the decklid came out good, and I thank yoos guys for the input!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Steve<BR><B>1988 Formula 2.8L</B> V6 5 speed <BR><FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> (Red and shiny all over!)</FONT>||||reg||12
Z||000011||artherd||12-11-2001||10:32 PM||||I simply proped the decklid open, then cut the torsion rods with an air cutoff wheel.   snaaap BOOM!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Rodney's struts are great, I picked up at least 0.1 in the 1/4th mile.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
